Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember when you first started coming here?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.86,0:00:05.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Back then I was doing that kind of stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.10,0:00:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I let it all out and it just came pouring out.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.02,0:00:10.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I had no distance from what I painted.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.02,0:00:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I was the painting.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.40,0:00:13.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I saw it didn't hold up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.12,0:00:14.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It didn't hold up at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.60,0:00:17.44,Default,,0,0,0,,All the banal, immature stuff that isn't art
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.44,0:00:18.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It came out of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.20,0:00:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,So I began working with more control.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.36,0:00:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I realized I had to have control.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.22,0:00:24.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Something to convey all my thoughts on art
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.74,0:00:26.80,Default,,0,0,0,,and how ruined it had become.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.80,0:00:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Life's emptiness, and so on.
